docs {
  # Get Outreach Tracker Detail
  
  Retrieves the complete detail of a single outreach tracker record by its unique identifier. Returns all outreach event details including location, dates, participant counts, activity descriptions, and impact assessment.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                                |
  |-----------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the outreach tracker record        |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete outreach tracker record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "outreachStartDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
      "outreachEndDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
      "outreachState": "string",
      "outreachLga": "string",
      "outreachCity": "string",
      "outreachCommunity": "string",
      "numVolunteers": 10,
      "numBeneficiaries": 50,
      "outreachType": ["string"],
      "activityDescription": "string",
      "impactStories": "string" | null,
      "challengesEncountered": "string" | null,
      "recommendations": "string" | null,
      "submittedBy": "string",
      "submissionDate": "YYYY-MM-DD",
      "updatedAt": "ISO 8601" | null,
      "createdAt": "ISO 8601",
      "deletedAt": "ISO 8601" | null
    }
  }
  ```
  
  The result is cached under the key `cedarrise:outreaches:outreach:<id>` using the `FORM_DATA` TTL.
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                  | Type     | Description                                              |
  |------------------------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------|
  | id                     | string   | UUID primary key.                                        |
  | outreachStartDate      | string   | Start date of the outreach (`YYYY-MM-DD`).               |
  | outreachEndDate        | string   | End date of the outreach (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                 |
  | outreachState          | string   | State where the outreach took place.                     |
  | outreachLga            | string   | LGA where the outreach took place.                       |
  | outreachCity           | string   | City where the outreach took place.                      |
  | outreachCommunity      | string   | Community targeted by the outreach.                      |
  | numVolunteers          | number   | Number of volunteers involved (≥ 0).                     |
  | numBeneficiaries       | number   | Number of beneficiaries reached (≥ 0).                   |
  | outreachType           | string[] | Types of outreach activities conducted.                  |
  | activityDescription    | string   | Description of activities performed.                     |
  | impactStories          | string   | Impact stories from the outreach (nullable).             |
  | challengesEncountered  | string   | Challenges encountered during outreach (nullable).       |
  | recommendations        | string   | Recommendations for future outreaches (nullable).        |
  | submittedBy            | string   | Name of the person who submitted the record.             |
  | submissionDate         | string   | Date of submission (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                       |
  | updatedAt              | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).            |
  | createdAt              | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                   |
  | deletedAt              | string   | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).               |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).              |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                 |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | Authenticated user lacks `read` permission.              |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                 |
}
